pan style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">一、PVP是什么？&nbsp; &nbsp; 二、我为什么要参与PVP？&nbsp; &nbsp; 三、怎么玩好<span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span>PVP？</span></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\">一、<span style=\"\"></span>PVP是什么</span></span></span></div></div><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; 1、PVP是一种常驻玩法，为5V5与其他玩家阵容对抗且你方可以手动操作或设置后自动挂机。</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">设置技能只适用进攻方防御时无效（所以手动操作更具上分优势）。</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">参与位置与技能设置位置展示</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"596\" data-height=\"558\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_596/h_558/1069/87565/2022/7/8/590463.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_596/h_558/1069/87565/2022/7/8/590463.png\"></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"598\" data-height=\"65\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_598/h_65/1069/87565/2022/7/8/449473.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_598/h_65/1069/87565/2022/7/8/449473.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0.37333rem;text-align:left;\"><img data-width=\"595\" data-height=\"857\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_595/h_857/1069/87565/2022/7/8/874138.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_595/h_857/1069/87565/2022/7/8/874138.png\"><br></div></div>\n                               </div><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2、挑战门票基础10张每15分钟增加一张自然恢复最多10张，每日可购买10次1次购买10张，耗费100个钻石，购买时门票个数可超过10张。可设置根据条件自动连续挑战和手动更新对手列表。</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">门票及购买展示</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"169\" data-height=\"115\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_169/h_115/1069/87565/2022/7/8/959775.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_169/h_115/1069/87565/2022/7/8/959775.png\"><img data-width=\"143\" data-height=\"111\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_143/h_111/1069/87565/2022/7/8/232558.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_143/h_111/1069/87565/2022/7/8/232558.png\"><img data-width=\"544\" data-height=\"192\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_544/h_192/1069/87565/2022/7/8/532300.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_544/h_192/1069/87565/2022/7/8/532300.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"495\" data-height=\"740\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_495/h_740/1069/87565/2022/7/8/392615.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_495/h_740/1069/87565/2022/7/8/392615.png\"></div><br></div></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">二、<span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></span>我为什么要参与PVP</span></span></div></div><br></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1、每日任务奖励（钻石、金币、PVP硬币）</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">列表位置与展示（部分）</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"560\" data-height=\"100\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_560/h_100/1069/87565/2022/7/8/310032.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_560/h_100/1069/87565/2022/7/8/310032.png\"></div></div><img data-width=\"575\" data-height=\"711\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_575/h_711/1069/87565/2022/7/8/810046.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_575/h_711/1069/87565/2022/7/8/810046.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\"></div>\n                               </div>2、周排名奖励（钻石、金币、血石、PVP奖杯）</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 血石可以进行还魂（<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">推荐用法</span>），在红石商店购物（<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">不推荐用法</span>），奖杯可以兑换界面上方奖励（两位NPC天子、点火石）</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">排名每周日北京时间11点结算！</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">奖励查看位置 与奖励消费位置</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"593\" data-height=\"820\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_593/h_820/1069/87565/2022/7/8/636509.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_593/h_820/1069/87565/2022/7/8/636509.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"141\" data-height=\"135\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_141/h_135/1069/87565/2022/7/8/168686.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_141/h_135/1069/87565/2022/7/8/168686.png\"><img data-width=\"146\" data-height=\"150\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_146/h_150/1069/87565/2022/7/8/900369.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_146/h_150/1069/87565/2022/7/8/900369.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"589\" data-height=\"970\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_589/h_970/1069/87565/2022/7/8/751086.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_589/h_970/1069/87565/2022/7/8/751086.png\"></div><br></div><br></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">三、<span style=\"\"></span>怎么玩好PVP</span></div></div><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">点击文章名称超链接直接打开</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1、基础资料</span></div></span></div><blockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">PVP天子如何选择《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/164262.html\" target=\"_blank\">天子选择引导</a>》</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">PVP装备选择《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/80674.html\" target=\"_blank\">装备节奏榜</a>》或打开PVP界面第二项看天梯怎么用（22年8月）以后应该全是地狱制作的新装备了</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">PVP附魔选择《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/50536.html\" target=\"_blank\">附魔图鉴</a>》《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/87997.html\" target=\"_blank\">S附魔简评推荐</a>》</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">PVP魂卡选择《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/96710.html\" target=\"_blank\">马冬梅和牛夫人</a>》（全魂卡攻略）</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">PVP点火选择《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/95715.html\" target=\"_blank\">点火石图鉴版</a>》</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">PVP人偶选择（见下方攻略）</span></div></blockquote></span><blockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div></blockquote><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">2、综合攻略</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;《<span style=\"\"><a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/81419.html\" target=\"_blank\">PVP攻略高阶</a></span>》 PVP进阶详解 ——By鲨鱼布丁</span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/163844.html\" target=\"_blank\">BG天梯前百攻略</a>》如何荣登PVP天梯排行榜——By海洋饼干</span></div></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/163338.html\" target=\"_blank\">霸榜计划</a>》什么是BG（这个人怎么这么嚣张啊？拜托你看看这些连接有几个不是他写的攻略</span>）</div></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"\"><br></div></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_596/h_558/1069/87565/2022/7/8/590463.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_595/h_857/1069/87565/2022/7/8/874138.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_495/h_740/1069/8